-- Original, house-styled rework: the technical heart of the ancient cosmos. The
-- deferent-and-epicycle machine that manufactures retrograde loops from uniform
-- circles with the Earth AT REST; the ECCENTRIC and the brilliant, controversial
-- EQUANT (uniform motion only as seen from an offset point); why the Almagest endured
-- ~14 centuries (it WORKED, and meshed with Aristotelian physics); the THOUSAND-YEAR
-- BRIDGE through the Islamic Golden Age (the name 'Almagest' itself, al-Battani,
-- al-Sufi, the Maragha school and Ibn al-Shatir, the Tusi couple reappearing in
